- Oh my God.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.583
You don't really wanna
answer the question.

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:24.540
- I think the truth of the matter is,

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:25.890
is like,

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.770
I'm encouraged because
there's so many more

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.330
