00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.350
Executive producing,

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:32.183
producing,

00:00:32.183 --> 00:00:33.016
writing,

00:00:33.016 --> 00:00:33.849
directing,

00:00:33.849 --> 00:00:35.400
ushering forward stories

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.750
that aren't typically,

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:37.710
you know,

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.990
pushed forward by the cis white male.

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:40.823
Right?

00:00:40.823 --> 00:00:41.797
- Yeah.
- You know?

00:00:41.797 --> 00:00:43.230
And so I'm excited because there's

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.570
so many voices

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:46.890
to be excited about.

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:47.723
However,

00:00:47.723 --> 00:00:48.556
we have so far to go,

00:00:48.556 --> 00:00:49.710
