00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:15.893
and our own land.

00:01:15.893 --> 00:01:16.726
Yeah
- Amen.

00:01:16.726 --> 00:01:17.700
Yeah.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:18.960
- It's an interesting topic

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:19.793
in general,

00:01:19.793 --> 00:01:21.030
